set_mode(Leader) publishes the new mode without fdatasyncing the change
marker: a power cut can lose the marker while the new leader's writes,
synced later, survive, so the history that follows has no identity and a
forked follower is not refused (#397).
Guarded-by: "a promotion whose fdatasync fails degrades and keeps the mode; resume finds its marker once"

